# Input Password

A password input field with a toggle button to show or hide the password content.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/input-password.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/input-password.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/input-password.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { InputPassword } from '@/registry/input-password'

const password = ref('')
</script>

<template>
  <InputPassword 
    v-model="password" 
    placeholder="Enter your password" 
  />
</template>
```

