### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `placeholder` | `string` | `undefined` | The input placeholder text. |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` | Whether the input is disabled. |
| `v-model` | `string` | `undefined` | The password value. |
